// Global, conditional (crates/velt_loader/src/globals): `Math.log1p`, `Math.log2` and `Math.log10`
// (velt/lang/math/logs_functions), for a program that calls one; other programs don't load the
// ports behind them, and a program that calls one loads no other group's.
// load when std/prelude/math uses: .log1p .log2 .log10
import "velt/lang/math/logs_functions";
